          "category": "skill",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You often rely on the local populace for supplies and shelter. Once per day, you can attempt a check to [[/act request]] or [[/act coerce]] against an easy DC for your level when speaking with someone who is a non-hostile, long-term resident of your favored location. On a success, choose one of the following to obtain.</p><ul><li>A nonmagical item of your level or lower</li><li>A safe place to shelter for 24 hours</li><li>3 days' worth of food and water for you and up to 5 allies</li></ul>"
          },
